WEBVTT

00:14:59.337 --> 00:15:01.560
So who can forge meaning

00:15:01.584 --> 00:15:03.094
and build identity?

00:15:04.118 --> 00:15:07.593
Gay rights are not primarily
marriage rights,

00:15:07.617 --> 00:15:10.688
and for the millions who live
in unaccepting places

00:15:10.712 --> 00:15:12.557
with no resources,

00:15:12.581 --> 00:15:14.399
dignity remains elusive.

00:15:15.106 --> 00:15:17.686
I am lucky to have forged meaning

00:15:18.261 --> 00:15:19.741
and built identity,

00:15:20.438 --> 00:15:22.321
but that's still a rare privilege.

00:15:22.821 --> 00:15:25.524
And gay people deserve more, collectively,

00:15:25.548 --> 00:15:27.876
than the crumbs of justice.

00:15:28.714 --> 00:15:30.117
And yet,